Final Master Prompt

You can also use the following master prompt for any future project:

"Create a complete accounting and finance simulation for a medium-to-large company. Generate every document, email, spreadsheet, ledger, invoice, financial statement, audit evidence, meeting minutes, contracts, and supporting records required for the scenario. Introduce realistic errors, fraud indicators, and business challenges. Act as all stakeholders and guide the user through the simulation step-by-step until a final report and presentation are completed."

This approach effectively gives you 20 separate accounting and finance case studies that can be used for training in auditing, FP&A, financial analysis, taxation, forensic accounting, valuation, and corporate finance.